{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 83714, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 58553, "uid": 94239, "type": 4, "title": "PVP中的deBuff", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1627270037, "updated_at": 1638781446, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1638781446, "last_at": 1677051579, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "作为pvp手操双刀党，经常被不明debuff击中。久而久之，哪些debuff是真的恶心，哪些是纸老虎，我总结出一个小小的排名。1.控制类DEBUFF（按先后顺序排名）※沉默。真正的theworld，被", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6289, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 83714, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">作为pvp手操双刀党，经常被不明debuff击中。久而久之，哪些debuff是真的恶心，哪些是纸老虎，我总结出一个小小的排名。<div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">1.控制类DEBUFF（按先后顺序排名）</p></div><br><div id=\"false\">※沉默。真正<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span>的the world，被击中冷却条都不动，充能条也归零，天子就这样离开了你的世界。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>强打（气绝）:强打是气绝的plus版，多了一个减防。强打也是俗称的眩晕，相比沉默冷却条秒数是会动的。但是如果你的天子只剩一两个了，中了强打就会被对面一直暴打</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>睡眠:技能槽清0，防御变0，无法行动，但是一被击中会清醒。相比强打逊色些许。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>石化:在受到攻击之前都无法行动。单看效果排在第四，但新光盾的石化是很强的。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>混乱:纸老虎般的debuff，在混乱状态下你不仅能读秒，而且能转充能条，甚至还能手动点技能涨ds条，debuff一结束就能反甩对面一巴掌。</div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">2.退条、减速、加CD类DEBUFF<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">（按先后顺序排名）</span></p></div><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>技能初期化。简单粗暴的描述，代表人物暗丽莎，她的出现终结了双刀的时代。<br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span></span>感电.不如减条来的痛快，但兼具了dot+退条，也是不错的debuff<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>减速类debuff（冰盾，时间改窜）:减速并不能影响到转满条的天子。相反，如果一个初期化打到一个满条的天子，那对面就白转了。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>加秒数debuff:在现在pvp，基本上一个ss定胜负，加个2秒无伤大雅。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>延时初期化（雪球，水气球）代表人物wb老板，排球，属于是过几秒后初期化，那时候大概被对面干掉了。</div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">4、特殊类DEBUFF</p></div><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>魅惑:期间无法上buff，类似蛾子的n也解不掉。除非魅惑解除（我无效你的无效）<br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>魔力爆发:魔力爆发有时候是会被免疫的。而且魔力爆发的伤害有延迟，手操的时候一定要等一会再划下一个天子的技能，防止伤害溢出。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>标的:相对于给对面上了个挑衅，经常会伤害溢出，得不偿失。</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>失明:出现miss可以躲避伤害，但躲不了debuff</div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">5.总结</p></div><br></div><div id=\"false\">排名最终还要和实际队伍搭配结合。<br></div><div id=\"false\">但在一定程度上说明哪些天子值得抽，比如黑猫的沉默，蒙眼的强打，光盾的挑衅接触石化。以后再出混乱天子，一定要仔细思量一番。</div></span><div id=\"false\"></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 94239, "username": "Summer", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/9.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 142653784, "content_num": 36, "read_num": 102386, "like_num": 31}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": fal